" title=\"Enclave Library\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enclave Library\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Enclave_Library\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enclave Library\">Enclave Library</a>, at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-442&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;35</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A long list of owlbear sightings in the region, separated by date. The latest entry (written a tenday ago), says '<a href=\"/wiki/Owlbear_Cub\" title=\"Owlbear Cub\">cub!</a>' The word is underlined several times.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714212446\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1662/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24825/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6495/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936940/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.157      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   52.157      1 -total\n 59.25%   30.905      7 Template:Icon_text\n 53.16%   27.729     17 Template:Trim\n 38.63%   20.148